Added the [[Hard Line Breaks Plugin]]: two spaces, or two spaces and a backslash, before the line end make a hard line break anywhere, list items and headings included, as in CommonMark. The rule gives editors that write WikiText a readable form for a line break. See [[the discussion|https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/issues/10025]].
